What this licence covers
------------------------

The code in this repository (the animation in video/kit/src/, the renderer, the Python and Node tools, the tests and
the figure scripts) is released under the MIT licence below.

Not covered by the MIT licence:

- The song "Don't Go Quiet On Me" (the audio in audio/final/dgq_master.mp3), its lyrics (lyrics.txt, lyrics/final/
  and the lyric files in audio/suno/dgq/) and the music video are (c) 2026 Neel Nanda. All rights reserved.
- The base animation kit in video/kit/ is ClaudeAnimationBase by John Heibel, also MIT; its original notice is kept in
  video/kit/LICENSE.
- The fonts in video/kit/assets/fonts/ are under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 (their own authors' copyright).
- tools/checks/flashcheck.py is adapted from Jesse Caple's flashcheck.py (github.com/jessecaple/pdoom), MIT.

